%h1.control-legend{data: {toggle: "collapse", target: "#authored-tours-container"}}
  Product Tours

#authored-tours-container.in.collapse
  - library = ProductTour.all(@level.game&.app).index_by {|tour| tour['id']}
  - references = @level.properties['tour_references'] || []
  %p
    A product tour walks a student through the lab one step at a time. Tours
    live in a library shared by every level of this lab; a level picks the ones
    it uses.
  - if references.empty?
    %p This level uses no tours from the library.
  - else
    %ul
      - references.each do |reference|
        - tour = library[reference['id']]
        %li
          = tour ? tour['name'] : "#{reference['id']} (missing from the library)"
          = "(#{reference['autoStart'] ? 'starts on its own' : 'from the resource panel'})"
  - if @level.persisted?
    %p= link_to 'Edit tours in the lab', edit_blocks_level_path(@level, :authored_tours), target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener'
  - else
    %p Save the level to add tours.
